{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方两行最大号的白字与紫色高亮主标题首先吸引视线，尤其是“舍不得被当作自己人的日子”和“连那些气也肯再受”；随后注意到下方醒目的“一阵心慌”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他似乎想回去，却说不清自己为什么想回去；具体是哪种处境和动机，第一眼不一定能判断清楚。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舍不得、怕孤单、心慌。\",\n  \"missed\": \"想回去的两种原因之间的完整关系：究竟是怀念曾经被接纳的感觉，还是害怕孤独到愿意重新忍受委屈。下方的心慌是想到这种可能性后的反应。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"主标题虽然字号很大，但两行长句包含多层意思，需要读完整才能理清两种回去动机的区别。\",\n    \"核心处境主要在上方主标题，心慌的反应在下方另一块，需要把两块联系起来。\",\n    \"中间四行较小正文连续堆叠，快速扫视时不容易提取具体信息。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c64a7bbd-bf10-42f8-b739-9212132e7d8b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T012900623648Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:30:07.337308+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c1063dbfcb8cfe567256d85dc18c2eaff04df67ac3bda6e40909447508c8eb9d", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f